{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Drevolesye \u2014 a village where every building breathes drafts, every resident sighs deeply, and hope for a better future is already packing its bags.</strong><br>Here, fate (and one overly enthusiastic landlord) brings you \u2014 a failed hero, an accidental builder, and perhaps the last hope for salvation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the demo, you'll find:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Village Restoration</strong> \u2014 build, repair, and upgrade initial structures to breathe life into the deserted streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743710/extras/nearbyTavern.gif?t=1749135299\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Meet the Locals</strong> \u2014 from a grumpy innkeeper to a mysterious fisherman. Each has their own story, and you've got your own troubles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fishing and Logging</strong> \u2014 battle stubborn trees, catch elusive fish in mini-games, and gather resources, remembering to breathe occasionally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743710/extras/fishing_cutDownTrees.gif?t=1749135299\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddd2\ufe0f <strong>First Quests</strong> \u2014 story-driven and random tasks that give a taste of village life and hint at deeper tales to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743710/extras/quest.gif?t=1749135299\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is just the beginning.</strong><br>The demo is your first shovel into the world of Drevolesye. Fix